---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Pickraft"
  description="Terms for using Pickraft's free online image tools."
  canonical="/terms"
  heading="Terms of Service"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Agreement</h2>
    <p>
      By using imgify.com, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the
      site.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">The service</h2>
    <p>
      Pickraft provides free online image conversion tools, including format converters and image to
      PDF. Tools are provided at no charge and without requiring an account.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Your content</h2>
    <p>
      You keep ownership of any images you use with our tools. You are responsible for ensuring you
      have the right to use and convert those images. Do not use Pickraft to process unlawful or
      infringing content.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">No guarantees</h2>
    <p>
      Pickraft is provided &ldquo;as is.&rdquo; We do not guarantee that tools will be error-free,
      available at all times, or suitable for every use case. Conversion results may vary by device
      and file type.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, Pickraft and its operators are not liable for any loss or
      damage arising from your use of the site, including lost data, corrupted files, or business
      interruption.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the service at any time. We may also update
      these terms; continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms? Email
      <a href="mailto:hello@imgify.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hello@imgify.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
